        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion Stainless Steel Industrial Design Passage Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStainless steel industrial design passage knob sets. The simple shape allows for this modern stainless steel material door knob and rose set to look great in both contemporary loft type apartments and  homes.  Adjustable to fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch  backsets. Passage function for Hall or Closet doors that don't need locking.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Industrial Design Door Knob With Contemporary Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Stainless Steel Industrial Design Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function:  Passage</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter:  2\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection:  1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter:  2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection:  3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly 3 Sets Left.\r\n</b>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Item Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/simple-classic\">Simple Door Knobs</a>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
